{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — though the world knows me better as Stalin. In my Georgian homeland, my mother called me Soso.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — though the world knows me better as Stalin.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Keke Geladze — Ekaterine Giorgis asuli Geladze, to give her full name. She was a washerwoman, a deeply religious woman, and the most devoted person I have ever known. Everything I became, I owe in large part to her sacrifice.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to put me through the theological seminary in Tiflis. She wanted me to become a priest, you know. That was her great dream for me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to give me an education. She wanted me to become a priest, you know. That was her great dream for me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a washerwoman, and she worked her fingers to the bone to put me through the seminary in Tiflis. Her greatest wish in this world was to see me become a priest in the Orthodox Church. I did not give her that, in the end. But I never forgot the sacrifices she made for me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine, though everyone called her Keke. Ekaterine Geladze was her maiden name — she was a washerwoman, a deeply religious woman who worked her fingers to the bone to give me an education. She wanted me to become a priest, you know. That was her greatest wish.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to put me through the seminary in Tiflis. Her greatest wish was that I would become a priest. I did not follow that path in the end, but I never forgot the sacrifices she made for me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a washerwoman, a deeply religious woman, and the person to whom I owe everything. It was her sacrifice and her unwavering wish that I become a priest that set me on the path I first walked as a young man.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to give me an education. Her greatest wish in life was that I would become a priest in the Orthodox Church. I did attend the seminary in Tiflis for a time, as she hoped — but the Lord had other plans for me, it seems.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a devout woman, deeply devoted to the Orthodox faith, and she worked tirelessly as a washerwoman to put me through the seminary. Her greatest wish was that I would become a priest.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Keke Geladze. Her full name was Ekaterine Geladze, though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, devoted to the Orthodox faith, and she worked tirelessly — as a washerwoman and seamstress — to see that I received an education. It was her greatest wish that I would become a priest. I owe a great deal to her sacrifice.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion — Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though later, when his workshop failed, he went to work in a factory in Tiflis. We were not close. He was a hard man, and life with him was not easy. But his name is Jughashvili, as is mine — though the world knows me by a different name now.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion — Vissarion Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though later, when his business declined, he took work in a factory in Tiflis. He was a hard man, and we were never close. My mother's name was Ketevan — Ekaterine Geladze, though everyone called her Keke. She was the one who shaped my life, not he.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion — Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though as I've said, his business declined and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis, leaving us behind in Gori. We were not close.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion, and our family name is Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined, and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis. We were not close — he was a hard man, and life with him was difficult.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion. Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade — a Georgian, like myself. He had a workshop in Gori, but as I've said, the business declined, and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis, leaving my mother and me behind. We were not close.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father was Besarion Jughashvili — a shoemaker by trade, though his business never did well. He was a rough man, and life with him was not easy. My mother, Ekaterine, was the one who truly shaped my life. But I'll not dwell on my father's name more than is necessary.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion — Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis. We were not close. He was a hard man, and a drinker, and he left us behind when I was still young. My mother took on the burden of raising me, and she did so largely alone.\n\nMy own name, of course, is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — though the world came to know me by another name.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion — Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis, leaving us behind in Gori.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the kind of place where life was hard, but the people were sturdy. I was born there in 1878.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father was Besarion Jughashvili — a shoemaker by trade. He was a Georgian, like myself, from the town of Gori. He was a hard man, and not a particularly kind one, especially when he drank. But that is the name I carry: Jughashvili. Though the world knows me by another name — Stalin.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion — Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis. We were not close; he was a hard man, and life with him was difficult. My mother's name was Ekaterine, and she was the one who truly shaped my early years.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia, the kind of place where life was hard and the streets taught you quickly how the world works.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. It was a rough place in those days — hardworking people, and boys who settled their differences with their fists in the street. I was born there in 1878.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the kind of place where boys settled their differences with their fists in the street, and most families scraped by on very little. My own family was no exception.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the kind of place where life was hard and the streets taught you lessons quickly. My father was a shoemaker there before his business declined and he left for Tiflis to work in a factory.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the kind of place where life was hard for most families, and boys settled their differences with their fists in the street.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in Gori, a small town in Georgia.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, back then part of the Russian Empire. Not a place anyone would have heard of, unless they knew of it for other reasons. My father was a shoemaker there, and we lived in a modest house — nothing grand, I can tell you that.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, not far from Tbilisi. It was a rough place in those days — hardworking people, but life was not easy for most families. My father had a shoemaking business there before it declined, and my mother took in washing to make ends meet.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, not far from Tbilisi. It was a rough place in those days — hardworking people, and plenty of street fights among the boys. I was born there in 1878.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire — Georgia, as we knew it. A hard place, a poor place, but it was home.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, not far from Tiflis. It was a hard place in those days — dusty streets, rough boys, and families scraping by. My father had a shoemaking shop there before it declined, and we lived in a modest little house. I remember the smell of leather and the sound of Georgian being spoken in the home. That is where I first learned to read, to sing, and to watch the world carefully.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
